  "fixes": [
    "Require explicit BYOK selection and isolate 31 competing backend/auth/transport selectors; pin nine model slots without changing proxy/CA or subscription environments.",
    "Retain native continuity after authenticated Factory manual/automatic compaction; renew user-turn bindings and retire only the authenticated handoff predecessor.",
    "Enforce current Factory native-tool capabilities in official PreToolUse, including revocation/bypass; hold Spec read-only until its exact successful ExitSpecMode receipt.",
    "Preserve full JSON Schema validation constraints with Ajv and revisioned MCP names; reject stale calls and support annotated draft-07 dependencies.",
    "Enable actual CLI Spec ExitSpecMode permission while respecting explicit exclusions.",
    "Correct final SSE input-token usage; explicitly reject unsupported output contracts before session creation.",
    "Provide local BYOK Droid generation and actual /relay-droid command, with exclusive file creation and real child invocation proof.",
    "Resolve the control page connection status and verify actual browser approve/deny/cancel actions."
  ],
